Z||000008||1FST2M6||01-15-2001||02:37 PM||||I have 2 T-28s super 60s. those are for sale too... I just picked up a 350 TPI. for FREE!! the owner of the Machine shop that does all Engineereds work had it laying there.. all collecting dust... it's owner droped it off and neglected to pay for anything to be done to it... its a BONE stock 350 with 85k-ish on it from an IROC /Z28 camaro.  And Predator has a turbo.. we can't have 2 of the same power plants in the same town now can we!!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">  you need a BTM and coil... i think we've got a set... i'll look in the morning when i'm down there... Use Nology or Accel 8.8mm wires... and NGK UR5 plugs.  ||||reg||1
Z||000009||BBBAD GT||01-15-2001||06:28 PM||||I got a T3 Turbo in my 'new' Mustang SVO I just picked up.  I'll put out 15lbs of boost stock, and I've heard of guys going to 20 with the T3.  One note, the Tbird turbo coupe's had a different turbo, one that spools up faster, but only maxes out at 15lbs of boost, incase anybody is looking in the boneyards for T3's and think the turbo coupes had them (at least the later one, not sure of the 84-85 Tbirds).  <P>Gotta love forced induction.....<P>------------------<BR>     <IMG SRC="http://scribers.midwest.net/bbbad50/V8Fiero/V8sig.jpg">     <P><A HREF="http://scribers.midwest.net/bbbad50/V8Fiero" TARGET=_blank>BBBAD V8</A><P><A HREF="http://scribers.midwest.net/bbbad50/Fiero.htm" TARGET=_blank>BBBAD GT</A><P><A HREF="http://scribers.midwest.net/bbbad50/" TARGET=_blank>BBBAD 5.0</A>||||reg||1
